<h1 style="margin: 0px 0px 17.39px;padding-top: 25px;text-align: left;color: #fefefe;line-height: 1.3;font-family: Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;font-weight: 400;border-collapse: collapse !important;-ms-word-break: keep-all;-ms-word-wrap: normal;-ms-hyphens: none;-moz-hyphens: none;-webkit-hyphens: none;hyphens: none;">ขอแสดงความยินดีที่มีคุณสมบัติตามเกณฑ์ที่กำหนด!</h1><br/>
</th>
<th class="callout-inner" style="padding:15px;"><img src="https://intel--c.documentforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0153b000005OXH2&oid=00Do0000000aRcf&lastMod=1609662404000" alt="Intel" title="Intel" align="right" class="float-center" style="height:100%;width:auto"></th>
